"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a mutating, highly contagious fungus escapes a sealed facility, two employees – joined by a grizzled bioterror operative – must survive the wildest night shift ever to save humanity from extinction.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10829,\"title\":\"Tremors 3: Back to Perfection\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mnMryfLgC2fuW3nfY36QfWx0hBL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yoq6WVqA2kB8nDNG0xX16kPBvfB.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Survivalist Burt Gummer returns home to Perfection, to find that the little town has been shaken up again by morphing, man-eating Graboids.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":974931,\"title\":\"Totally Killer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/52YBwGJ3cJs54fpBzwnT1lnqgTo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qjMDwBWbG5hAP43q3meplZFreFQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the infamous \\\"Sweet Sixteen Killer\\\" returns 35 years after his first murder spree to claim another victim, 17-year-old Jamie accidentally travels back in time to 1987, determined to stop the killer before he can start.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":62214,\"title\":\"Frankenweenie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yGjVbLVdZRBlZTTQVBsj2KUjL1s.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yfTZ2MSRWc06cBrFOsAF4Lebi4.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a car hits young Victor's pet dog Sparky, Victor decides to bring him back to life the only way he knows how. But when the bolt-necked \\\"monster\\\" wreaks havoc and terror in the hearts of Victor's neighbors, he has to convince them that Sparky's still the good, loyal friend he was.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":82654