ar\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"What does it take to become a Stepford wife, a woman perfect beyond belief? Ask the Stepford husbands, who've created this high-tech, terrifying little town.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1205229,\"title\":\"Night of the Zoopocalypse\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nCejOVZcOxKS27nnbh28NKXOdXF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h2SEtzuABKmcZAnKBJ1za3kETTY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A wolf and mountain lion team up when a meteor unleashes a virus turning zoo animals into zombies. They join forces with other survivors to rescue the zoo and stop the deranged mutant leader from spreading the virus.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":523849,\"title\":\"The Last Sharknado: It's About Time\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fNMIepqPpg4QN3D0O0SPgvt29w3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5IPGuBlBx4QGWhLe1mGFrtXa6Xh.jpg\",\"rating\":4.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Our hero Fin has battled sharks all over the globe, but in this last installment he will tackle the final shark-tier - time travel.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1094274,\"title\":\"Y2K\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qndubIQalyxBJI5EBNZKGXEX74q.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/47bsGWAEtJNWMcd3oNS7TELmi6v.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two high school nobodies make the decision to crash the last major celebration before the new millennium on New Year's Eve 1999. The night becomes even crazier than they could have ever dreamed when the clock strikes midnight.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":841781,\"title\":\"Someone Dies!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kh3DCUgC7lHe1LfBowZqA0R